					"speakerTitle": "蘭難世"
				},
				{
					"id": 730410602,
					"content": "蘭難世也這麼快被找到，跟蘭梨婁一樣弱！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730410603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭梨婁"
				},
				{
					"id": 730410603,
					"content": "嗚…都弱，只有金色的那菈強…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730410604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭難世"
				},
				{
					"id": 730410604,
					"content": "這樣下去可不行，要鍛煉蘭迦拉梨，有了很強的蘭迦拉梨，那菈朋友一定就找不到了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730410605,
						730410607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭梨婁"
				},
				{
					"id": 730410605,
					"content": "應該不是這個道理…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730410606
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730410606,
					"content": "那菈朋友是不是怕輸？玩遊戲，不要在乎輸贏！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730410609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭梨婁"
				},
				{
					"id": 730410609,
					"content": "雖然輸了，但是玩得開心，金色的那菈果然是好那菈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730410610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭梨婁"
				},
				{
					"id": 730410610,
					"content": "那菈朋友贏了。好厲害！收下我們的花吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730410611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭難世"
				},
				{
					"id": 730410611,
					"content": "#謝謝好那菈！{F#妳}{M#你}是好朋友！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭梨婁"
